    {
      "name": "RefreshServerInfo",
      "signature": "()",
      "kind": "function",
      "summary": {
        "text": "仅在非特殊且非过度版本时try解析mx.ini refreshserver为float；解析成功才进else取now=misc.Time()，在(tm is None or tm>now or now-tm>1200)时selectserver.Refresh。解析异常只置tm=None，不进else刷新。BulletinURL的CHttpObject拉取在外层，前述门禁/不刷新不阻止后续文案请求（不保证成功）。1200是时间戳差阈值，不是CreatePyCommand计时参数。",
        "confidence": "static_reviewed",
        "evidence": [
          "n4_server_refresh"
        ]
      },
      "calls": [],
      "branches": [
        {
          "condition": "permission.GetSpecialVersion() or permission.GetOverdoVersion()",
          "effect": {
            "text": "跳过时间戳解析/列表刷新段；HTTP文案请求仍在外层。",
            "confidence": "static_reviewed",
            "evidence": [
              "n4_server_refresh"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "condition": "非特殊且非过度版本，float解析抛异常",
          "effect": {
            "text": "except只置tm=None；不会进入else，不能补成tm=None后自动刷新。继续外层HTTP文案请求。",
            "confidence": "static_reviewed",
            "evidence": [
              "n4_server_refresh"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "condition": "版本门禁通过且解析成功，else内(tm is None or tm>now or now-tm>1200)",
          "effect": {
            "text": "调用selectserver.Refresh(None)；tm>now为独立刷新条件，例如tm=101、now=100也命中，不能只看差<=1200。tm is None保留为候选字面谓词，不宣称float成功会返回None。",
            "confidence": "static_reviewed",
            "evidence": [
              "n4_server_refresh"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "condition": "版本门禁通过且解析成功，但完整OR谓词为假",
